# Each landscape's own grass (GrassSpecies, BiomeDef.grasses), in a held wind,
# over the shoulder and from above, and one front crossing grass, bush and tree.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/foliage_species.tour --seed=7
# 01-03: the coast's meadow by the wood, from above, half a second apart: a
# front crossing the sward and on into the scrub and the crowns. 04 the same
# over the shoulder. 05 marram on the dunes; 06-07 the moss's sedge and bog
# cotton, and walked through; 08-09 the pinewood's fern and bracken; 10 the salt
# flats' straw; 11 the moss from above, where each grass must still read as
# itself at play height.
weather clear:0:wind=0.9
hour 10
coast calm
place coast
near meadow
wait 2.5
shot 01-front-over-grass-bush-and-tree with land:coast
wait 0.5
shot 02-front-half-a-second-on with land:coast
wait 0.5
shot 03-front-a-second-on with land:coast
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
wait 1.0
shot 04-meadow-and-wood-over-the-shoulder with land:coast
place coast
near dune
wait 1.5
shot 05-coast-marram-on-the-dunes with land:coast
place moss
ground moss
wait 1.5
shot 06-moss-sedge-and-bog-cotton with land:moss
walk 0,-1 0.6
wait 0.5
shot 07-moss-walked-through with land:moss
place pinewood
ground grass
wait 1.5
shot 08-pinewood-fern-and-bracken with land:pinewood
ground needles
wait 1.5
shot 09-pinewood-bracken-under-the-pines with land:pinewood
place salt_flats
ground salt
wait 1.5
shot 10-salt-flats-straw with land:salt_flats
release shoulder_peek
await top_view 3
place moss
ground moss
wait 1.5
shot 11-moss-from-above with land:moss
weather rules
